[h2]Build 0.9.28[/h2]
[h3]Fixed[/h3]
[list]
[*]Loaders and Movers could not take from storage buildings that keep their items inside themselves (crates and deep-storage units with a "Contained items" list) rather than on their cells, so they found nothing to send. They now take from those too, as well as from shelves, stockpiles and passing belts.
[/list]
